{"version":2,"slug":"shopping-italian-food-and-puppy-time","videoId":"nxO_fQCTVIk","videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/nxO_fQCTVIk","lang":"en","title":"shopping, Italian food, and puppy time!","category":"Vlog","channel":"Happy New Year! Slow English vlog","channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/@BoSlowEnglish","captionSource":"auto","tags":["Video","easy English","tv series"],"backUrl":"/","lines":[{"start":0,"text":"Hello everyone and happy New Year."},{"start":3,"text":"Welcome to a new episode of those slow"},{"start":7,"text":"English. Today we are at Century City"},{"start":11,"text":"Mall. We came to eat Italian food on New"},{"start":15,"text":"Year's Day."},{"start":17,"text":"We have Italian beer,"},{"start":20,"text":"Italian wine, a restaurant called Capri."},{"start":27,"text":"We are going to be eating at Terra,"},{"start":30,"text":"which is a wood-burning Italian grill"},{"start":35,"text":"restaurant."},{"start":38,"text":"In Los Angeles, people bring their dogs"},{"start":42,"text":"everywhere."},{"start":44,"text":"Have you ever had limoncello?"},{"start":49,"text":"It is a"},{"start":50,"text":"lemon"},{"start":52,"text":"liqueur,"},{"start":53,"text":"I think."},{"start":57,"text":"Okay. It is time to check in to our"},{"start":61,"text":"reservation at Terra."},{"start":67,"text":"They still have holiday decorations up."},{"start":73,"text":"We're heading up the spiral staircase."},{"start":76,"text":"My husband is wearing"},{"start":78,"text":"all new clothes today. That is his New"},{"start":83,"text":"Year's tradition."},{"start":85,"text":"Ooh."},{"start":90,"text":"Smells nice and smoky."},{"start":93,"text":"We have checked in with the host."},{"start":102,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":105,"text":"Thank you. Happy New Year."},{"start":109,"text":"We are ordering little gem salad,"},{"start":113,"text":"which has coal roasted beets, Sicilian"},{"start":118,"text":"pistachio pesto,"},{"start":120,"text":"So."},{"start":121,"text":"and orange. We're also getting cavatelli"},{"start":125,"text":"and"},{"start":126,"text":"house-made bread."},{"start":129,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":131,"text":"We have the little gem salad with the"},{"start":134,"text":"orange,"},{"start":135,"text":"beets, and crushed pistachios,"},{"start":140,"text":"and our grilled bread"},{"start":143,"text":"with a little scoop of"},{"start":146,"text":"butter and a dash of salt."},{"start":150,"text":"We just received the cavatelli,"},{"start":154,"text":"which has a ragout"},{"start":156,"text":"of beef and pork."},{"start":160,"text":"And I'm very excited to eat it."},{"start":165,"text":"We had a nice lunch."},{"start":171,"text":"Now we are going to walk around the"},{"start":175,"text":"mall,"},{"start":177,"text":"and"},{"start":179,"text":"I'm very curious to see if we will be"},{"start":182,"text":"doing"},{"start":183,"text":"window shopping because a lot of the"},{"start":186,"text":"stores might be closed"},{"start":189,"text":"for the holiday."},{"start":191,"text":"What a beautiful"},{"start":193,"text":"wine bottle."},{"start":197,"text":"I tried to learn Italian for a couple of"},{"start":201,"text":"months,"},{"start":202,"text":"but it was very hard to juggle learning"},{"start":206,"text":"Italian, French, and Korean."},{"start":210,"text":"So, unfortunately, I gave up."},{"start":214,"text":"We have some fresh fish,"},{"start":218,"text":"Atlantic salmon fillets,"},{"start":221,"text":"wild halibut,"},{"start":224,"text":"swordfish,"},{"start":228,"text":"steelhead trout,"},{"start":231,"text":"Chilean sea bass,"},{"start":234,"text":"and more salmon."},{"start":237,"text":"Ooh, this black cod looks delicious."},{"start":242,"text":"Striped bass,"},{"start":245,"text":"branzino"},{"start":246,"text":"came all the way from Greece."},{"start":249,"text":"We got some whole fish."},{"start":252,"text":"This is Atlantic salmon again."},{"start":256,"text":"John Dory,"},{"start":258,"text":"striped bass."},{"start":261,"text":"Oh la la."},{"start":264,"text":"Langoustines, which I think are massive"},{"start":267,"text":"shrimp."},{"start":269,"text":"Soleil oysters,"},{"start":273,"text":"soleil in French means"},{"start":275,"text":"beautiful sun."},{"start":278,"text":"Prawns,"},{"start":280,"text":"can anyone tell me the difference"},{"start":282,"text":"between prawns"},{"start":284,"text":"and langoustines?"},{"start":289,"text":"Who likes uni?"},{"start":293,"text":"Lobster,"},{"start":296,"text":"wow,"},{"start":297,"text":"shrimp,"},{"start":300,"text":"octopus."},{"start":302,"text":"Beautiful meat."},{"start":305,"text":"Looks very fresh."},{"start":308,"text":"$21.99"},{"start":311,"text":"for"},{"start":313,"text":"each pound of Wagyu hamburgers."},{"start":320,"text":"Should we get a slice of pizza?"},{"start":330,"text":"This is Santa Monica Boulevard,"},{"start":334,"text":"the street that we"},{"start":337,"text":"drove on to"},{"start":340,"text":"enter the garage into the mall."},{"start":344,"text":"And over this way"},{"start":346,"text":"is Beverly Hills. Now we are heading"},{"start":350,"text":"down the escalator"},{"start":354,"text":"to go shopping. I feel like I need to"},{"start":357,"text":"stand in the sun"},{"start":360,"text":"for a moment."},{"start":361,"text":"I'm feeling very cold. Do you know the"},{"start":364,"text":"store called Sephora?"},{"start":368,"text":"It's a makeup store."},{"start":370,"text":"I love Aritzia."},{"start":372,"text":"Look at these massive puffers."},{"start":380,"text":"We are entering"},{"start":382,"text":"a department store called"},{"start":385,"text":"Bloomingdale's."},{"start":387,"text":"This department store is known to have"},{"start":391,"text":"expensive brands."},{"start":393,"text":"We've entered the men's department."},{"start":397,"text":"This is an interesting shirt,"},{"start":400,"text":"a leather shirt."},{"start":405,"text":"Jil Sander."},{"start":409,"text":"I like this"},{"start":411,"text":"puffy jacket."},{"start":413,"text":"I've always liked Marni's prints."},{"start":418,"text":"It's kind of retro-looking."},{"start":421,"text":"\"What are you looking for today?\""},{"start":424,"text":"He said, \"Anything and everything.\""},{"start":428,"text":"My husband loves to shop more than me."},{"start":432,"text":"My sister-in-law"},{"start":434,"text":"got me a gift card to Lululemon,"},{"start":439,"text":"which is a"},{"start":441,"text":"famous and popular"},{"start":444,"text":"workout gear store. So, I think I would"},{"start":449,"text":"like to go in"},{"start":451,"text":"and take a look around. Looks like they"},{"start":454,"text":"are doing some construction here."},{"start":457,"text":"I'm considering buying a backpack here."},{"start":462,"text":"So, I would like to see it in person"},{"start":464,"text":"first. Can you please check to see if"},{"start":467,"text":"there is a laptop compartment inside the"},{"start":470,"text":"backpack?"},{"start":474,"text":"And there is."},{"start":476,"text":"Do you think it'll fit my laptop?"},{"start":478,"text":"Great."},{"start":479,"text":"So, this is a consideration."},{"start":482,"text":"I would call this color a slate"},{"start":486,"text":"gray? Would you say?"},{"start":488,"text":"Oh, just slate."},{"start":490,"text":"$54."},{"start":492,"text":"I wish I had my Lululemon gift card,"},{"start":497,"text":"but I guess I will just purchase it"},{"start":499,"text":"online."},{"start":501,"text":"This backpack has more compartments"},{"start":504,"text":"in the front."},{"start":511,"text":"We are now heading in to another"},{"start":514,"text":"department store"},{"start":516,"text":"called Nordstrom."},{"start":525,"text":"Perfect. I wanted to look at their"},{"start":528,"text":"shoes."},{"start":530,"text":"I am looking for"},{"start":533,"text":"rain boots because in the wintertime"},{"start":538,"text":"it rains a little bit in Los Angeles."},{"start":541,"text":"Not too much, but a little bit. So, I do"},{"start":544,"text":"want to be prepared."},{"start":547,"text":"Do you know this brand, Golden Goose?"},{"start":551,"text":"It's very popular in Los Angeles."},{"start":556,"text":"They're known to have distressed-looking"},{"start":561,"text":"sneakers"},{"start":563,"text":"for $500."},{"start":566,"text":"Distressed means"},{"start":568,"text":"kind of used, beat up, worn."},{"start":573,"text":"So, people pay"},{"start":575,"text":"over $500"},{"start":577,"text":"for shoes that look like they've already"},{"start":580,"text":"been worn."},{"start":581,"text":"Would you buy shoes like that?"},{"start":584,"text":"This is a $400"},{"start":587,"text":"rain boot. It's heavy, too."},{"start":590,"text":"How much does it weigh?"},{"start":592,"text":"They're really nice, though."},{"start":594,"text":"It looks like it weighs 3 lb. Hi."},{"start":598,"text":"Here's the sale rack."},{"start":601,"text":"I am size"},{"start":605,"text":"5 and 1/2"},{"start":606,"text":"and 6."},{"start":611,"text":"I don't like any of these shoes."},{"start":615,"text":"We have sandals,"},{"start":619,"text":"heels,"},{"start":623,"text":"stilettos,"},{"start":625,"text":"boots."},{"start":627,"text":"I like these boots."},{"start":630,"text":"We are heading back to our car"},{"start":634,"text":"in the garage."},{"start":635,"text":"I like that this watch has"},{"start":639,"text":"the silver and the gold on the band."},{"start":645,"text":"I am not a fan of the ones with diamonds"},{"start":649,"text":"around it. I think it looks kind of"},{"start":652,"text":"tacky."},{"start":653,"text":"This is the Apple store."},{"start":657,"text":"This brand's called Aesop is very"},{"start":659,"text":"popular. They sell"},{"start":662,"text":"skin care, but mostly soap and lotion."},{"start":667,"text":"This is a less popular brand of car"},{"start":672,"text":"called Lucid. I believe it's all"},{"start":676,"text":"electric."},{"start":678,"text":"This is a beautiful mall, isn't it?"},{"start":682,"text":"What do you think?"},{"start":685,"text":"This type of style"},{"start":688,"text":"is considered preppy."},{"start":692,"text":"Where I grew up in Baltimore, Maryland,"},{"start":696,"text":"I used to see a lot of this type of"},{"start":699,"text":"style."},{"start":701,"text":"Looks like my husband wants to go"},{"start":703,"text":"shopping."},{"start":704,"text":"We are heading into"},{"start":706,"text":"COS."},{"start":713,"text":"I like this bag."},{"start":716,"text":"It has interesting"},{"start":719,"text":"asymmetries."},{"start":725,"text":"I like the fuzzy hat."},{"start":731,"text":"This is a nice-sized"},{"start":734,"text":"purse."},{"start":736,"text":"I guess he's not buying anything today."},{"start":740,"text":"We're already leaving."},{"start":742,"text":"I'm not a huge fan of that brand"},{"start":746,"text":"because the clothes are too big for me."},{"start":750,"text":"I used to really like this brand called"},{"start":753,"text":"Sandro."},{"start":754,"text":"It's a French brand"},{"start":757,"text":"or as"},{"start":758,"text":"the French would pronounce it,"},{"start":760,"text":"Sandro."},{"start":762,"text":"Nice jackets."},{"start":764,"text":"This is the men's section."},{"start":767,"text":"That's a fun skirt."},{"start":771,"text":"It's netted"},{"start":772,"text":"with rhinestones."},{"start":776,"text":"This looks like a professional"},{"start":779,"text":"section."},{"start":781,"text":"Usually, you will see the brand Maje"},{"start":785,"text":"across from Sandro."},{"start":788,"text":"We are going down the escalator"},{"start":791,"text":"to the parking garage."},{"start":795,"text":"We parked on P2 orange."},{"start":800,"text":"We need to pay for our parking ticket."},{"start":809,"text":"First, we insert the parking ticket"},{"start":813,"text":"and then it will tell you how much it"},{"start":816,"text":"costs."},{"start":818,"text":"We tapped our credit card"},{"start":822,"text":"and now it will spit out the parking"},{"start":825,"text":"ticket again."},{"start":829,"text":"We're going back home."},{"start":831,"text":"I'm going to take my dog for a walk."},{"start":835,"text":"Do you know what it means to have a New"},{"start":839,"text":"Year's resolution? A New Year's"},{"start":842,"text":"resolution is when you set goals for"},{"start":846,"text":"yourself starting January 1st."},{"start":851,"text":"It could be anything"},{"start":854,"text":"relating to your personal life or"},{"start":857,"text":"career,"},{"start":859,"text":"whatever it is."},{"start":860,"text":"I don't have a New Year's resolution"},{"start":863,"text":"yet. I guess"},{"start":865,"text":"I could come up with one right now,"},{"start":869,"text":"which is to have more fun"},{"start":873,"text":"and"},{"start":874,"text":"not take life too seriously."},{"start":878,"text":"I have a lot of changes"},{"start":881,"text":"happening in my life"},{"start":883,"text":"and I am excited to see what"},{"start":888,"text":"2025"},{"start":891,"text":"will bring for me."},{"start":893,"text":"How about you?"},{"start":894,"text":"While we are"},{"start":896,"text":"driving home, let's ask my husband"},{"start":899,"text":"what"},{"start":900,"text":"Recalculating route."},{"start":902,"text":"Okay, that was my car navigation. Let's"},{"start":906,"text":"ask my husband, what is your New Year's"},{"start":909,"text":"resolution?"},{"start":912,"text":"To ride over 1,000 mi in 1 year."},{"start":916,"text":"Uh"},{"start":917,"text":"I was almost there with like I think I"},{"start":919,"text":"had like 800 and something,"},{"start":921,"text":"but I started in"},{"start":924,"text":"I think May."},{"start":926,"text":"So, it's definitely doable, but"},{"start":930,"text":"a goal of mine."},{"start":932,"text":"Can you please specify what you mean by"},{"start":935,"text":"riding over 1,000 mi? What are you"},{"start":938,"text":"riding?"},{"start":939,"text":"Riding my bike over 1,000 mi in 1 year."},{"start":945,"text":"And how many miles did you ride today?"},{"start":948,"text":"36."},{"start":950,"text":"Do you feel accomplished?"},{"start":953,"text":"Great way to start the year."},{"start":955,"text":"Bravo."},{"start":958,"text":"He is closer"},{"start":960,"text":"to his goals."},{"start":963,"text":"We are currently on the 405 freeway"},{"start":967,"text":"in California."},{"start":970,"text":"We put the word"},{"start":972,"text":"the"},{"start":974,"text":"in front of the freeway name."},{"start":978,"text":"So, it's the 405,"},{"start":981,"text":"the 110,"},{"start":983,"text":"the 10,"},{"start":985,"text":"the 5."},{"start":986,"text":"There's a reason for this"},{"start":989,"text":"and I can't remember why."},{"start":991,"text":"We are about"},{"start":993,"text":"5 minutes away from home."},{"start":996,"text":"It's quite sunny today."},{"start":998,"text":"I can't wait to see my dog."},{"start":1001,"text":"I should probably say that"},{"start":1004,"text":"one of my New Year's resolutions for"},{"start":1007,"text":"this year is to post more videos for"},{"start":1010,"text":"you. Duh."},{"start":1012,"text":"Nari."},{"start":1014,"text":"You ready to go for a walk?"},{"start":1019,"text":"Happy New Year, Nari. After Christmas is"},{"start":1023,"text":"done, people throw their"},{"start":1026,"text":"pine trees, Christmas trees I should"},{"start":1028,"text":"say,"},{"start":1029,"text":"on the sidewalk to be picked up by a"},{"start":1035,"text":"Christmas tree pickup service. I think"},{"start":1038,"text":"it's pretty wasteful to purchase a"},{"start":1043,"text":"tree"},{"start":1044,"text":"and use it only for a week and then"},{"start":1048,"text":"throw it away."},{"start":1050,"text":"Ooh."},{"start":1051,"text":"Nari is doing a number two."},{"start":1055,"text":"Can you guess what number two means?"},{"start":1058,"text":"Nari likes to sniff the grass."},{"start":1063,"text":"Aw."},{"start":1064,"text":"Look at that squirrel."},{"start":1067,"text":"Sometimes it's hard to walk her because"},{"start":1070,"text":"she is so curious"},{"start":1072,"text":"and wants to sniff every step she takes."},{"start":1079,"text":"We are home now."},{"start":1081,"text":"We just got inside the house"},{"start":1084,"text":"and this is my cat, Louis. He is resting"},{"start":1090,"text":"on the heated blanket."},{"start":1092,"text":"Isn't Louis handsome? He is 6 years old,"},{"start":1099,"text":"but sometimes he still acts like a"},{"start":1102,"text":"kitten."},{"start":1104,"text":"He's very curious,"},{"start":1107,"text":"playful,"},{"start":1109,"text":"sometimes a little too playful. This is"},{"start":1112,"text":"the end of my New Year's vlog. I hope"},{"start":1117,"text":"you learned some new vocabulary"},{"start":1120,"text":"and I look forward to seeing you soon."},{"start":1123,"text":"Happy New Year."}]}